    "Recent places, the connected device identifier and downloaded maps are stored on the phone. The home screen can clear recent searches; the maps and offline downloads screen can delete downloads and clear the temporary cache. Deleting the app removes its local data; system backups may contain part of it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lugares recentes, o identificador do aparelho conectado e os mapas baixados ficam no celular. A tela inicial limpa as buscas recentes; a tela de mapas e downloads offline apaga downloads e limpa o cache temporário. Apagar o app remove os dados locais; backups do sistema podem guardar parte deles."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近地点、已连接设备标识和下载地图保存在手机上。首页可清空最近搜索；地图与离线下载页面可删除下载包、清理临时缓存。删除 App 可移除它的本地数据；系统备份可能包含部分本地数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
